  "commit_message": "[LwDetr] Initialize encoder heads like the detection heads (#50041)\n\n* Fix LwDetr encoder head init to match the detection heads\n\nInitialize enc_out_class_embed biases with the focal-loss prior and zero the\nlast enc_out_bbox_embed layer, as the original implementation does by\ndeep-copying class_embed/bbox_embed after their init.\n\n* fix comment+modular\n\n* fix test\n\n* identical topks\n\n* that one too\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pablo Montalvo <pablo.montalvo.leroux@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pablo ",
